2. HIGH-LEVEL ARCHITECTURE & CLEAN MODULAR MONOLITH DESIGN
================================================================================
The backend is architected as a Clean Modular Monolith in Spring Boot 3.3.3. While contained within a single deployable artifact for operational simplicity, modules maintain strict boundaries, modular package encapsulation, and decoupled services.

       [ Client Applications: React 18 / Vue 3 / Flutter / React Native Mobile ]
                                 │
                                 │ (HTTPS + Firebase JWT + TOTP Challenge)
                                 ▼
         ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
         │             Spring Security 6 Stateless Pipeline            │
         │  (FirebaseAuthFilter + RateLimitingFilter + SecurityHeaders)│
         └──────────────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────┘
                                        │
        ┌───────────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────┐
        ▼                               ▼                               ▼
  [User & Identity]             [2FA / TOTP Engine]             [Mosque Directory]
   - Firebase Sync               - RFC 6238 TOTP                 - PostGIS ST_DWithin
   - RBAC Roles                  - otpauth:// QR URI             - Amenity Filters
   - Gamification Points         - Single-Use Backup Codes       - Cover Media
        │                               │                               │
        ▼                               ▼                               ▼
  [Claim Management]            [Community & Q&A]               [Prayer Times Engine]
   - Legal Proofs                - 5-Star Reviews                - AlAdhan Calculation
   - Anti-Self Approval          - Questions & Answers           - Iqamah Offsets/Fixed
   - Imam Verification           - Content Flags & Moderation    - Jumu'ah Schedules
        │                               │                               │
        ▼                               ▼                               ▼
  [Events & Khutbahs]           [Media Storage]                 [OSM Ingestion Engine]
   - Live Streams                - Cloudflare R2 / S3            - Overpass Geo Crawler
   - Jummah Archives             - Magic-Byte Validation         - 50m Deduplication
        │                               │                               │
        ▼                               ▼                               │
  [Push Notifications]          [Crowdsource Moderation]                │
   - Firebase Cloud Messaging    - Field-Level Diff Audit               │
   - Multi-Device Tokens         - Anti-Self Approval                   │
   - Stale Token Pruning         - Contributor Badges                   │
        │                               │                               │
        └───────────────────────────────┴───────────────────────────────┘
                                        │
                                        ▼
         ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
         │             Hibernate Spatial 6.5 + JTS Topology            │
         └──────────────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────┘
                                        │
                                        ▼
         ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
         │          PostgreSQL 16+ with PostGIS Spatial Extension      │
         │               (Hosted on Neon Serverless Cloud)             │
         └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

