7. DATABASE SCHEMA & FLYWAY MIGRATION LOG (V1 to V14)
================================================================================
- V1: PostGIS extension activation and users table.
- V2: Facilities catalog and mosques table with spatial geometries.
- V3: Crowdsourced mosque_submissions and moderation_logs.
- V4: Mosque ownership claim management (mosque_claim_requests).
- V5: Prayer times config and Iqamah schedules.
- V6: Rich production seed data across global metropolitan hubs.
- V7: Community reviews, Q&A, events, khutbahs, content flags.
- V8: Production seed data for community modules.
- V9: User preferred GPS location and radius preferences.
- V10: Custom manual Adhan time overrides.
- V11: Bookmarks (user_favorite_mosques) and contributor badges.
- V12: In-app user notifications table.
- V13: Proof document URL migration to TEXT.
- V14: Multi-device push notification registry (user_devices) and 2FA TOTP columns on users.

