8. COMPREHENSIVE BREAKDOWN OF ALL 11 CORE MODULES
================================================================================
8.1. User & Identity Module: Sync, profiles, points, preferences.
8.2. Two-Factor Authentication (2FA/TOTP): RFC 6238 setup, QR enrollment, challenge verification, backup codes.
8.3. Mosque Directory & Facilities: Directory, spatial search, amenity filtering, slug lookup.
8.4. Mosque Ownership Claims: Verification workflow for Imams/Trustees with proof documents and anti-self-approval.
8.5. Dynamic Prayer Times & Iqamah Engine: AlAdhan integration, timezone-aware calculation methods, fixed/offset Iqamah schedules, Jummah times.
8.6. Community Engagement: 1-5 star reviews, community Q&A with verified answer badges, content flags.
8.7. Events & Friday Khutbahs: Mosque calendar, conference announcements, sermon archives with stream URLs.
8.8. Media Storage Module: Cloudflare R2 / S3 storage with magic-byte validation and traversal prevention.
8.9. Crowdsourcing Moderation & Gamification: Proposals, field-level diff audits, reviewer audit logs, contributor points, and badges.
8.10. Notifications & Multi-Device FCM Push: In-app notification center, device token registration, multicast push alerts on Iqamah changes.
8.11. OSM Ingestion Engine: Overpass API geospatial harvester with 50-meter spatial deduplication.

