9. EXHAUSTIVE API REFERENCE CATALOG (ALL 58 REST ENDPOINTS)
================================================================================
--- SYSTEM & OBSERVABILITY ---
1. GET /v3/api-docs (Public)
2. GET /swagger-ui.html (Public)
3. GET /actuator/health (Public)

--- TWO-FACTOR AUTHENTICATION (2FA/TOTP) ---
4. POST /api/v1/auth/2fa/setup (Authenticated) - Initiate 2FA enrollment, returns Base32 secret & otpauth:// URI.
5. POST /api/v1/auth/2fa/enable (Authenticated) - Confirm 6-digit TOTP code, enables 2FA and returns 8 backup codes.
6. POST /api/v1/auth/2fa/verify (Authenticated) - Verify TOTP or backup recovery code challenge.
7. POST /api/v1/auth/2fa/disable (Authenticated) - Step-up authentication to disable 2FA.
8. GET /api/v1/auth/2fa/status (Authenticated) - Check 2FA status and remaining backup codes count.
9. POST /api/v1/auth/2fa/backup-codes/regenerate (Authenticated) - Regenerate backup recovery codes with step-up verification.

--- USER & IDENTITY ---
10. POST /api/v1/users/sync (Public) - Synchronize / onboard Firebase user to PostgreSQL.
11. GET /api/v1/users/me (Authenticated) - Current user profile, role, points, and badges.
12. PUT /api/v1/users/me/location (Authenticated) - Update user preferred GPS coordinates and radius.
