================================================================================
10. DEVOPS, CLOUD DEPLOYMENT & DATABASE INFRASTRUCTURE
================================================================================
10.1. Neon Serverless PostgreSQL:
- Host: Neon Serverless AWS (Pooled connection, sslmode=require).
- Native PostGIS: Extensions CREATE EXTENSION IF NOT EXISTS postgis;
- Validation Mode: spring.jpa.hibernate.ddl-auto=validate (Flyway manages all DDL).

10.2. Cloudflare R2 Media Storage:
- S3-compatible, zero-egress cost object storage.
- Environment variables: CLOUDFLARE_R2_ACCESS_KEY, CLOUDFLARE_R2_SECRET_KEY, CLOUDFLARE_R2_ENDPOINT, CLOUDFLARE_R2_BUCKET, CLOUDFLARE_R2_PUBLIC_URL.

10.3. Render Deployment:
- Docker web service with Spring Boot multi-stage build.
- Health Check: /actuator/health returns 200 UP.

