================================================================================
12. AI REVIEWER CHECKLIST & CODE AUDIT PROMPTS
================================================================================
When reviewing this backend as an AI agent, focus on:
1. Spatial Index Utilization: Ensure ST_DWithin uses geography casting on mosques.location with GIST indexing.
2. RBAC & IDOR Protections: Verify claimRequestRepository.findByMosqueIdAndClaimantIdAndStatus ensures Mosque Admins cannot modify mosques they do not own.
3. Anti-Self Approval: Verify moderators and claimants cannot approve their own submissions.
4. Upload Safety: Verify FileSecurityValidator is called before any binary byte write to disk or cloud storage.
5. Push Multicast & Cleanup: Verify NotificationService prunes invalid/unregistered device tokens when FCM returns UNREGISTERED.

--- END OF SPECIFICATION ---
